  "description": "USN-8997-1 fixed a vulnerability in Net-SNMP. This update provides the\ncorresponding fix for Net-SNMP on Ubuntu 20.04 LTS, Ubuntu 18.04 LTS,\nUbuntu 16.04 LTS and Ubuntu 14.04 LTS.\n\nOriginal advisory details:\n\n It was discovered that Net-SNMP incorrectly handled newly accepted\n connections in the SMUX module. An unauthenticated remote attacker could\n possibly use this issue to cause Net-SNMP to block indefinitely,\n resulting in a denial of service.",
